{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_060_1080_p", "source_sha256": "a539afa2e0b7194d14f286ecf3420a13221f85dfa20821f5a6daac0b35b1bba5", "ja": "……そうですね、あずささん。\nそうなんだと思います。", "zh": "……是啊，雅兹莎小姐。\n我想，应该就是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_060_1081_046rio", "source_sha256": "6206d90b53d4df785e1c10dba018390ebba446065ba8ca49a099b95b2ea28a23", "ja": "え、なに？\nどういうこと、{$P$}くん？", "zh": "诶，什么？\n到底是怎么回事，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_060_1082_p", "source_sha256": "911d67df68dfd6d603d8456054389c2e14958b528463d91443d8aff0c64679c3", "ja": "つまり……莉緒はこの曲を聞いて、\nドキドキしてくれたんだよな？", "zh": "也就是说……莉绪听了这首歌，心里怦怦直跳了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_060_1083_046rio", "source_sha256": "b8c6a98fd3af5d0250b87bdae1f1eb68afab363497909cb474fc55dca0dffa67", "ja": "え、ええ……そうね。みんなも言ってくれたけど、\n素敵な曲だもの。せつない気持ちが伝わってきて……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……是啊。大家也都这么说，这首歌真的很棒。那份伤感的心情传达过来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_060_1084_046rio", "source_sha256": "f7ef35a0434d41248f58fc3b8a77af2dcd6a8469c25da7d84d91fe3e839b1643", "ja": "あ。伝わってきて……？", "zh": "啊。传达过来……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_060_1085_016tsu", "source_sha256": "27e7ff383c4e018b7d970220059fafb2a9ecf23a5351479371a6007594d2ec1f", "ja": "あれ？　じゃあ、みんなをドキドキさせるってことは、\n恋をさせるってことになるんですか？", "zh": "咦？那让大家小鹿乱撞，\n就等于是让他们坠入爱河了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_060_1086_052kao", "source_sha256": "87937a5ffded5afefec9a588466b6d122ee7cb18fb56a113c306f499ac36fe52", "ja": "そうね。それはとっても難しいことだと思うの。\nでも……。", "zh": "是啊。我觉得，那是非常困难的事。\n不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_060_1087_007ior", "source_sha256": "4975d29d4a930b90327ed6248d189e0a19815525ebc082108b5afe2c076c57ef", "ja": "莉緒はそういう、ドキドキする気持ちをこめて、\n歌えばいいのよ。だって……。", "zh": "莉緒只要把那种怦然心动的感觉融入歌声就好了。因为……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_060_1088_010azu", "source_sha256": "7c3b9b3907f2908d2d6fd3f88ca87e8b82ae6c94357141f7fafe5a6036691f5f", "ja": "恋する気持ちは、伝わるものだから。\n私達みんな、曲を聞いただけでドキドキしたんだもの♪", "zh": "恋慕的心情，是一定能够传达出去的。\n我们大家光是听了这首歌，就已经怦然心动了呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_060_1089_p", "source_sha256": "60578aaccda1c6a5cc75748088fff11e43cd96f4806f5c13431da909fdfd9881", "ja": "そして、きっと誰よりも、莉緒が感じてくれてるから。\nこの曲に込められている、そういう気持ちを。", "zh": "而且，我相信莉绪一定比任何人都更能感受到……这首歌中寄托的那份心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_060_1091_052kao", "source_sha256": "692b0ab0bfee5e8ab7883e9d1595c9917de7672b2b447b1400b85360e18a3b4c", "ja": "ふふっ。ねえ、莉緒ちゃん。今の莉緒ちゃんの\n胸の中のドキドキは……どれくらい？", "zh": "呵呵。莉绪，你现在心里的悸动……有多强烈呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_060_1092_046rio", "source_sha256": "500b61c28abe5edb5e06253af160f096606454f3943806609ccf046f6ac5b162", "ja": "今の私の、胸の中の……ドキドキは……。", "zh": "现在的我，心中的……心跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_060_1093_046rio", "source_sha256": "f8549de9173a66b062bf49018ec8d65969e88093a33ddc960f80ea42e40c3b5b", "ja": "……うんっ。劇場から飛び出しそうなくらい、\n私、ドキドキしてるっ！　もう止まらないくらい♪", "zh": "……嗯。我的心跳，快得都要从剧场里飞出来了！\n简直停不下来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_060_1094_p", "source_sha256": "9e263c35c4011509b542711bc56dcadeb86bc4aa7d71cf8431fcb00afca00ae9", "ja": "……そっか。それじゃあ……\n間違いなく、伝えられるな！", "zh": "……这样啊。那……\n肯定能够传达到的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_060_1095_046rio", "source_sha256": "acc724d9c5945a88726f7270360c11830e1914e405417554577e04a37cdf644a", "ja": "ええ！　ありがと、{$P$}くん！\nそれから、みんなも！", "zh": "没错！谢谢你，{$P$}！\n还有大家也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_060_1096_046rio", "source_sha256": "b935d358d477d40783d8e07c81dcb52702552d24ffdff9c18af97c537ed1acb4", "ja": "私、バッチリ伝えられると思うわ。\nドキドキする気持ち……と、それだけじゃなくて。", "zh": "我觉得我能完美地传达出来。\n那种怦然心动的感觉……还不止这些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_060_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_060_1097_046rio", "source_sha256": "d2acb717c50e8d38e45947d5083c4d263bcf63d45aa84a5088f47b91868f7692", "ja": "せつなくて、ハラハラして、じれったくて、もう\nいてもたってもいられない気持ちも！　ウフフ♪", "zh": "既难过，又忐忑，还焦急得让人心里发痒，简直已经坐立难安的心情也要传达出来！　呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
